/**
 * Legacy batches R8-B1 to R8-B6 (Bill 2026-11-11: every publication is a version). In 78 families the Master List
 * (official text 2013-04-27) prints word for word an earlier text (the release-sheet slip; Death Star Gunner (V): the
 * 2010-06-17 errata) after the PC website card list (2012-07-21 to 2013-01-11, generated from the PC's Holotable card
 * data) had shown a different text. The Master List repeat is the latest version and the current card; the card-list text
 * moves to a new 22xx version class. No play changes (the card-list differences are wording, capitals, punctuation or
 * written-out icons). Bill 2026-11-11 09:14: the PC card image (server upload 2013-02-25) is its own version too, between the card
 * list and the Master List. Images are pinned in cardImageUrlTests.js.
 */
